{"task_id": "Mbpp/57", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the largest number that can be formed with the given list of digits.\nassert find_Max_Num([1,2,3]) == 321\n\"\"\"\ndef find_Max_Num(digits):\n    # Convert digits to strings and sort in descending order based on concatenation comparison\n    str_digits = [str(d) for d in digits]\n    \n    # Custom comparison: for two numbers a and b, compare a+b vs b+a\n    for i in range(len(str_digits)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(str_digits)):\n            if str_digits[i] + str_digits[j] < str_digits[j] + str_digits[i]:\n                str_digits[i], str_digits[j] = str_digits[j], str_digits[i]\n    \n    return int(''.join(str_digits))"}
