{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the nth number in the newman conway sequence.\nassert sequence(10) == 6\n\"\"\"\ndef sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[1] = dp[2] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[dp[i - 1]] + dp[i - dp[i - 1]]\n    \n    return dp[n]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/85", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the surface area of a sphere.\nassert math.isclose(surfacearea_sphere(10), 1256.6370614359173, rel_tol=0.001)\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef surfacearea_sphere(r):\n    \"\"\"Calculate surface area of sphere using formula 4*\u03c0*r\u00b2.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    return 4 * math.pi * r * r\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the nth number in the newman conway sequence.\nassert sequence(10) == 6\n\"\"\"\ndef sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Initialize sequence array\n    seq = [0] * (n + 1)\n    seq[1] = seq[2] = 1\n    \n    # Fill sequence using recurrence relation: P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq[i] = seq[seq[i-1]] + seq[i - seq[i-1]]\n    \n    return seq[n]"}
