{"task_id": "Mbpp/92", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check whether the given number is undulating or not.\nassert is_undulating(1212121) == True\n\"\"\"\ndef is_undulating(num):\n    \"\"\"Check if a number is undulating (alternates between exactly two different digits).\"\"\"\n    s = str(num)\n    if len(s) < 3:\n        return False\n    \n    # Get the first two digits\n    digit1, digit2 = s[0], s[1]\n    \n    # Check if they're different\n    if digit1 == digit2:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check if the pattern alternates throughout\n    for i in range(len(s)):\n        expected = digit1 if i % 2 == 0 else digit2\n        if s[i] != expected:\n            return False\n    \n    return True"}
