{"task_id": "Mbpp/99", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to convert the given decimal number to its binary equivalent, represented as a string with no leading zeros.\nassert decimal_to_binary(8) == '1000'\n\"\"\"\ndef decimal_to_binary(decimal_num):\n    \"\"\"Convert decimal number to binary string representation.\"\"\"\n    if decimal_num == 0:\n        return '0'\n    \n    binary = ''\n    while decimal_num > 0:\n        binary = str(decimal_num % 2) + binary\n        decimal_num //= 2\n    \n    return binary"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the next smallest palindrome of a specified integer, returned as an integer.\nassert next_smallest_palindrome(99)==101\n\"\"\"\ndef next_smallest_palindrome(n):\n    # Convert to string and find the next palindrome by incrementing and checking\n    num = n + 1\n    while True:\n        s = str(num)\n        if s == s[::-1]:\n            return num\n        num += 1"}
