{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the n'th lucas number.\nassert find_lucas(9) == 76\n\"\"\"\ndef find_lucas(n):\n    \"\"\"Find the n'th Lucas number using iterative approach.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    a, b = 2, 1\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b"}
