{"task_id": "Mbpp/643", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function that checks if a strings contains 'z', except at the start and end of the word.\nassert text_match_wordz_middle(\"pythonzabc.\")==True\n\"\"\"\ndef text_match_wordz_middle(text):\n    \"\"\"Check if string contains 'z' except at start and end of words.\"\"\"\n    words = text.split()\n    for word in words:\n        clean_word = ''.join(c for c in word if c.isalpha())\n        if len(clean_word) > 2:\n            middle = clean_word[1:-1]\n            if 'z' in middle:\n                return True\n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/641", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the nth nonagonal number.\nassert is_nonagonal(10) == 325\n\"\"\"\ndef is_nonagonal(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth nonagonal number using the formula n * (7n - 5) / 2.\"\"\"\n    return n * (7 * n - 5) // 2"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/643", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function that checks if a strings contains 'z', except at the start and end of the word.\nassert text_match_wordz_middle(\"pythonzabc.\")==True\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef text_match_wordz_middle(text):\n    \"\"\"Check if string contains 'z' in middle of words (not at start/end).\"\"\"\n    words = text.split()\n    for word in words:\n        clean_word = ''.join(c for c in word if c.isalpha())\n        if len(clean_word) > 2 and 'z' in clean_word[1:-1]:\n            return True\n    return False\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to reverse an array upto a given position.\nassert reverse_Array_Upto_K([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6],4) == [4, 3, 2, 1, 5, 6]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr, k):\n    \"\"\"Reverse array elements from index 0 to k-1.\"\"\"\n    return arr[:k][::-1] + arr[k:]\n```"}
