{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the minimum difference between any two elements in a given array. \nassert find_min_diff((1,5,3,19,18,25),6) == 1\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef find_min_diff(arr, n):\n    \"\"\"Find minimum difference between any two elements in array.\"\"\"\n    sorted_arr = sorted(arr)\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        diff = sorted_arr[i] - sorted_arr[i-1]\n        if diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = diff\n    \n    return min_diff\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/764", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to count number of digits in a given string.\nassert number_ctr('program2bedone') == 1\n\"\"\"\ndef number_ctr(string):\n    \"\"\"Count the number of digits in a given string.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for char in string:\n        if char.isdigit():\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the minimum difference between any two elements in a given array. \nassert find_min_diff((1,5,3,19,18,25),6) == 1\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef find_min_diff(arr, n):\n    # Sort the array to find minimum difference between adjacent elements\n    sorted_arr = sorted(arr)\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n    \n    for i in range(1, len(sorted_arr)):\n        diff = sorted_arr[i] - sorted_arr[i-1]\n        if diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = diff\n    \n    return min_diff\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/764", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to count number of digits in a given string.\nassert number_ctr('program2bedone') == 1\n\"\"\"\ndef number_ctr(s):\n    \"\"\"Count the number of digits in a given string.\"\"\"\n    return sum(1 for char in s if char.isdigit())"}
